                  <div class="col-sm-12 page-header clearfix">
                     <h1>Incoming Exchange Academics &amp; Class Selection</h1>
                  </div>
               </div>
               <div class="row">
                  <div class="col-sm-12 main-banner">
                     <!-- don't self close -->
                     <p><img src="/international/studyabroad/images/AcademicsClassesBanner18pt.png" alt="Academics &amp; Classes" width="1370" height="795"></p>
                  </div>
               </div>
               <div class="row">
                  <div class="col-sm-12 clearfix page-wrapper">
                     <div class="row">
                        <main id="maincontent" role="main" class=" col-sm-12">
                           <!-- don't self close -->
                           <h2 class="hrule">MSU Academic Majors</h2>
                           <ul>
                              <li>
                                 <p><a href="http://catalog.montana.edu/academic-programs/" target="_blank">MSU Academic Programs</a>&nbsp;</p>
                                 <ul>
                                    <li>
                                       <p><strong>Course Restrictions:</strong> Architecture, graphic design, and fine arts classes are extremely limited to non-degree
                                          students. Students must be majors in these subjects at their home universities and
                                          be able to present a portfolio of completed work. In most cases, students may not
                                          register for classes in these departments before arrival. Media, Theater, Film and
                                          Photo courses are usually not open to exchange students.</p>
                                    </li>
                                 </ul>
                              </li>
                           </ul>
                           <h2 class="hrule">MSU Course Search</h2>
                           <ul>
                              <li>
                                 <p>Use the links below to search for MSU classes. Please consult your <a href="https://montana.studioabroad.com/index.cfm?FuseAction=Security.LoginWizardStepOne">My Global Connection</a> application for information on how to register for courses.</p>
                                 <ul>
                                    <li>
                                       <p><a href="http://catalog.montana.edu/">MSU Course Catalog</a></p>
                                    </li>
                                    <li>
                                       <p><a href="https://atlas.montana.edu:9000/pls/bzagent/bzskcrse.PW_SelSchClass">MSU Course Search&nbsp;</a></p>
                                       <ul>
                                          <li>
                                             <p>Note: please search using the appropriate term (spring, fall, summer). Courses are
                                                subjective to change up until the start of the semester.&nbsp;</p>
                                          </li>
                                       </ul>
                                    </li>
                                    <li>
                                       <p><a href="https://www.montana.edu/registrar/Handbooks.html">MSU Registration Handbook</a></p>
                                    </li>
                                 </ul>
                              </li>
                              <li>
                                 <p>MSU course syllabi can be found by emailing the specific instructor of the courses.
                                    Please use the <a href="https://www.montana.edu/search/#gsc.tab=0">MSU Staff Directory</a> retrieve the email of the specific course instructor.&nbsp;</p>
                              </li>
                           </ul>
                           <p>&nbsp;</p>
                           <p><em>&nbsp;Note: that course offerings are subject to change and the above information does
                                 not guarantee enrollment in the course.&nbsp;</em></p>
                           <p>&nbsp;</p>
                        </main>
                     </div>
                  </div>
               </div>
